   "thumbUrl": "https://d1xhvexl2i3ere.cloudfront.net/makeree/res/9791a350-2205-4035-9366-fb966d690eb2_thumb.jpg",
   "text": "This guide assumes you have completed 'The Counter Project' guide and builds upon both its code and configuration.So, if you have not completed it, go there and return here after completing it.",
