   "thumbUrl": "https://d1xhvexl2i3ere.cloudfront.net/makeree/res/17578990-1ea9-49ff-9a25-2d22756093c4_thumb.jpg",
   "text": "Let's start by adding another button to the board, connecting it to pin D3 in a similar way to the previous button",
   "title": "",
